      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/htakawira\">@htakawira</a></p>\n<p>This is for v15<br>\nGo to stock reco tool<br>\nPurpose - stock reco<br>\nPut item code and warehouse - leave the quantity as it shows up - this will be the current quantity as per the stock ledger report (e.g. current stock is 64)<br>\nChange the value to the new value per item e.g. if all the items are 640 then each will now be 10 per unit<br>\nSubmit</p>\n<p>(the revaluation calculations are run every 1 hour so to see the result go to build scheduled job types, look for “repost_item_valuation.repost_entries” then click Execute)</p>\n<p>Attached are the examples i have done manually in excel and the system has done the same in erpnext</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/c/f/cff50702055828dae47ab5496b4da84937e24585.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/cff50702055828dae47ab5496b4da84937e24585\" title=\"Screenshot 2026-03-05 121345\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/f/cff50702055828dae47ab5496b4da84937e24585_2_690x388.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-03-05 121345\" data-base62-sha1=\"tFFNUQHA3fIeycLzwBKdaVnSEWV\" width=\"690\" height=\"388\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/f/cff50702055828dae47ab5496b4da84937e24585_2_690x388.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/f/cff50702055828dae47ab5496b4da84937e24585_2_1035x582.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/f/cff50702055828dae47ab5496b4da84937e24585_2_1380x776.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F5F5F6\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2026-03-05 121345</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×1080 321 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidde